# BTN open-raise 2.5x, 6-max 100bb cash.
#
# PROVENANCE: this is a conventional, widely-taught opening range, not solver
# output. TexasSolver is postflop-only, so preflop ranges are an *input
# assumption* — every postflop solution below is exact GIVEN this range, which
# is how all solver work operates. The app shows this range on screen as a
# stated premise rather than hiding it.
#
# Aggregate: ~45% of combos.
22+, A2s+, K5s+, Q7s+, J8s+, T8s+, 97s+, 86s+, 75s+, 64s+, 54s,
A2o+, K9o+, Q9o+, J9o+, T9o
